  "problem": "The five-card report collapsed PRICING AUTHORITY into SELF-PRICING / DIRECT-CUSTOMER PAYMENT. Card04 was hard-wired to 'from employer-priced person -> to someone strangers pay directly', Card05 to 'find strangers/quote yourself/outside the employer system', and the world rule to 'your craft only becomes yours the moment a stranger pays'. That is a universal disintermediation ideology, NOT a diagnosis. It forces everyone toward freelance/direct sales and implies SELF-PRICED is superior to EMPLOYER-PRICED. R85C3 separates pricingAuthority (WHO sets the price now) from pricingPower (HOW MANY credible alternative ways the value can be RE-PRICED), adds a deterministic SWITCH_TYPE (STAY_AND_UPGRADE | ADD_PRICING_SOURCE | SWITCH_GAME | UNKNOWN), makes card04 explicitly select one and card05 test that same one, and removes the entrepreneurship / direct-customer bias with defect-only detectors. Core principle: 让用户拥有更多被重新定价的选择，而不是让所有人自己定价。",
